From: fable-ct-audit <noreply@invalid>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 12:36:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] hostres+programsurface: opt-in aggregate cgroup parent slice
 for capsules (proposal, claude-fable-5-2, Track P)

---
 src/internal/hostres/cgroup.go       | 31 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/internal/hostres/cgroup_test.go  | 25 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/programsurface/hardening_test.go | 21 +++++++++++++++++++
 src/programsurface/launch.go         |  5 +++++
 4 files changed, 82 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/internal/hostres/cgroup.go
